ermline BRCA1 and BRCA2 Mutations in Jewish Women Affected by Breast Cancer [19]. Another is BRCA1 Haploinsufficiency and Gene Expression [25]. Another is Study to Evaluate Treatment Customized According to RAP80 and BRCA1 in Patients With Advanced Lung Carcinoma [30].",
